# ── model weights ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The four trained LoRA adapters ARE committed — they are only 14 MB each and
# they are the artifact behind every reported number. What is excluded:
#
#   runs/*/adapter/ref/     frozen reference adapters (28 MB each). Needed only
#                           to resume training, not to load or evaluate a model.
#   tokenizer files         identical across all four runs AND identical to
#                           Qwen/Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct. Load the tokenizer from
#                           the base model instead:
#                             AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained("Qwen/Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct")
#
# This keeps the repository around 60 MB instead of 230 MB while leaving every
# adapter directly loadable:
#   PeftModel.from_pretrained(base, "runs/gsm8k_tapr/adapter")

hackathon/runs/*/adapter/ref/
hackathon/runs/*/adapter/tokenizer.json
hackathon/runs/*/adapter/tokenizer_config.json
hackathon/runs/*/adapter/vocab.json
hackathon/runs/*/adapter/merges.txt
hackathon/runs/*/adapter/added_tokens.json
hackathon/runs/*/adapter/special_tokens_map.json
hackathon/runs/*/adapter/chat_template.jinja

# Training checkpoints — never committed, host large ones on HuggingFace
checkpoints/
*.bin
*.pt
*.ckpt

# Kept outside the repo — never publish
_archive/
_private/
machinery.html
RESEARCH_MACHINERY.md

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Environment / secrets
.env
*.key

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Scratch
/tmp/
scratch/
